talent for security experts

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:32.910
around the globe.

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:34.450
We keep them happy.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:35.430
We recruit them.

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:37.665
And we make sure that we
solve the great problems.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.310
And number two, the second
reason why this is true,

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:49.055
this will be true in 2020, is
when one customer's security

00:03:49.055 --> 00:03:52.310
