for all the customers, all

00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:59.480
the hundreds and
thousands of customers.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:02.090
This is not possible in
the private data centers.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:05.360
It's very difficult because
you have to know the community.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:07.589
You have to know what
the vulnerabilities are.

00:04:07.589 --> 00:04:09.380
You have to get the
right concerting people

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:11.510
